Design: We will apply per-sample L2 normalization to the averaged TTA embeddings before fitting the logistic regression and also normalize in the predict function. This normalization constrains embeddings to lie on the unit hypersphere, helping the classifier focus on angular differences. We update both training and prediction paths to call sklearn.preprocessing.normalize on the embedding matrix.
