Design: We apply per‐sample L2 normalization to the averaged TTA embeddings so that each embedding lies on the unit hypersphere. We update both the training pipeline (before fitting each logistic regression) and the `predict()` function (before calling `predict_proba`) to normalize the embeddings using `sklearn.preprocessing.normalize`. This encourages the classifier to focus on angular differences and can improve robustness.
